    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75762" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδᾰμ-ῶς</span></b> , Adv. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδαμός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in no wise</i>, <i><span class="en">
